description.narrative:
The goal of this Workplan is to contribute to achieving gender equality in and through education in Viet Nam. More specifically, the Workplan aims to support the Government of Vietnam in implementing the National Strategy on Gender Equality in the education sector. 

Examples of the activities to be implemented include: 
-	Provide advice and technical support to the Ministry of Education and Training to 1) strengthen gender equality dimensions in the new Teachers Law under preparation; 2) to integrate gender equality in teacher training curriculum in the framework of its implementation of National Strategy on Gender Equality. The modalities of support includes facilitating consultation processes and learning from international experiences; 
-	Maintain and strengthen a community of practice with teacher training institutions and teacher education to share knowledge and experience related to gender issues in education and gender mainstreaming in teachers’ professional development and teaching and learning; 
-	Co-organize or contribute to joint events and campaigns to promote gender equality in education with other UN agencies and partners (e.g. UNWomen).
